---

The GLB files in this folder (assets/houses/) are derived works of the
Geometry-Nodes assets in https://github.com/IRCSS/Blender-Geometry-Node-French-Houses
(file GeometryNodesFrenchHous.blend, upstream commit b49b3c1). They were
generated from it with tools/blender/ in this repository: evaluated, realised,
re-materialised with canonical material names, trimmed and exported to glTF.
The MIT licence above, including its copyright notice, applies to them.
